w5o|n|A stringed instrument of music resembling the lute or the violin, but larger, and having six strings, three of silk covered with silver wire, and three of catgut, -- played upon with the fingers.	a:nd5,94,1~nd5,94,1	N:1jg5,108,3;1ycv,79,1~1jg5,108,3;1ycv,79,1
