w5z|n|A hollow place in the earth; an abyss; a deep chasm or basin, ; That which swallows; the gullet. ; That which swallows irretrievably; a whirlpool; a sucking eddy. ; A portion of an ocean or sea extending into the land; a partially land-locked sea; as, the Gulf of Mexico. ; A large deposit of ore in a lode.	N:dfl,114,2;g7r,65,3~g7r,65,3;dfl,114,2
